// Test: Block expression with implicit ⤺
// Spec: 02-SYNTAX.md § 3.1 Block Expressions
// Priority: P0
//
// Purpose:
// Validates that block expressions ⤺ the last expression.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should compile and print 42

rite main() {
    ≔ x: !i32 = {
        ≔ y: !i32 = 40;
        y + 2
    };
    println(x);
}
